{"book":"hono","chapter":"guides","chapterTitle":"الأدلة","slug":"jsx","title":"`JSX`","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"الإعدادات","text":"الإعدادات"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام","text":"الاستخدام"},{"depth":2,"id":"رفع-البيانات-الوصفية","text":"رفع البيانات الوصفية"},{"depth":2,"id":"fragment","text":"Fragment"},{"depth":2,"id":"propswithchildren","text":"PropsWithChildren"},{"depth":2,"id":"إدراج-html-خام","text":"إدراج HTML خام"},{"depth":2,"id":"الحفظ-المؤقت","text":"الحفظ المؤقت"},{"depth":2,"id":"السياق","text":"السياق"},{"depth":2,"id":"مكون-غير-متزامن","text":"مكوّن غير متزامن"},{"depth":2,"id":"suspense","text":"Suspense"},{"depth":2,"id":"errorboundary","text":"ErrorBoundary"},{"depth":2,"id":"streamingcontext","text":"StreamingContext"},{"depth":2,"id":"التكامل-مع-البرمجية-الوسيطة-html","text":"التكامل مع البرمجية الوسيطة html"},{"depth":2,"id":"مع-برمجية-وسيطة-لعرض-jsx","text":"مع برمجية وسيطة لعرض JSX"},{"depth":2,"id":"تجاوز-تعريفات-الأنواع","text":"تجاوز تعريفات الأنواع"}],"html":"<p>يمكنك كتابة HTML ببنية JSX باستخدام <code>hono/jsx</code>.</p>\n<p>على الرغم من <code>hono/jsx</code> يعمل على العميل، وستستخدمه غالبًا عند تصيير المحتوى على جانب الخادم. إليك بعض الأمور المتعلقة بـ JSX المشتركة بين الخادم والعميل.</p>\n<h2 id=\"الإعدادات\">الإعدادات</h2>\n<p>لاستخدام JSX، عدّل <code>tsconfig.json</code>:</p>\n<p><code>tsconfig.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;compilerOptions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;jsx&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;react-jsx&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;jsxImportSource&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hono/jsx&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>بدلًا من ذلك، استخدم توجيهات pragma:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/** <span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@jsx</span> jsx */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/** <span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@jsxImportSource</span> hono/jsx */</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>بالنسبة إلى Deno، عليك تعديل <code>deno.json</code> بدلاً من <code>tsconfig.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;compilerOptions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;jsx&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;precompile&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;jsxImportSource&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;@hono/hono/jsx&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام\">الاستخدام</h2>\n<p>إذا كنت قادمًا مباشرةً من <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/#quick-start\">البدء السريع</a>، يحتوي الملف الرئيسي على <code>.ts</code> الامتداد - تحتاج إلى تغييره إلى <code>.tsx</code> - وإلا فلن تتمكن من تشغيل التطبيق إطلاقًا. يجب عليك أيضًا تعديل <code>package.json</code> (أو <code>deno.json</code> إذا كنت تستخدم Deno) لتعكس ذلك التغيير (على سبيل المثال، بدلًا من وجود <code>bun run --hot src/index.ts</code> في نص التطوير (dev script)، ينبغي أن يكون لديك <code>bun run --hot src/index.tsx</code>).</p>\n<p><code>index.tsx</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">FC</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Layout</span>: <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">FC</span> = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">props</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>{props.children}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Top</span>: <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">FC</span>&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">messages</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>[] }&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: {\n  messages: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>[]\n}</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Layout</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hello Hono!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>&gt;</span>\n        {props.messages.map((message) =&gt; {\n          return <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>{message}!!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n        })}\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Layout</span>&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> messages = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Good Morning&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Good Evening&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Good Night&#x27;</span>]\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Top</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">messages</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{messages}</span> /&gt;</span></span>)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"رفع-البيانات-الوصفية\">رفع البيانات الوصفية</h2>\n<p>يمكنك كتابة وسوم البيانات الوصفية للمستند مثل <code>&lt;title&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;link&gt;</code>، و <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code> مباشرة داخل مكوناتك. سيتم رفع هذه الوسوم (tags) تلقائيًا إلى <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> قسم من المستند. يكون هذا مفيداً بشكل خاص عندما <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> يتم عرض العنصر بعيدًا عن المكوّن الذي يحدد البيانات الوصفية (metadata) المناسبة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setRenderer</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">content</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n      \n        <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span>\n        <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>{content}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n      \n    )\n  })\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/about&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">render</span>(\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>About Page<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;description&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;This is the about page.&#x27;</span> /&gt;</span>\n      about page content\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<p>عند حدوث الرفع (hoisting)، لا تتم إزالة العناصر الموجودة. تتم إضافة العناصر الظاهرة لاحقًا إلى النهاية. على سبيل المثال، إذا كان لديك <code>&lt;title&gt;Default&lt;/title&gt;</code> في <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> ويُصيّر مكوّن <code>&lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;</code>، سيظهر كلا العنوانين في head.</p>\n<h2 id=\"fragment\">Fragment</h2>\n<p>استخدم Fragment لتجميع عناصر متعددة دون إضافة عُقد (nodes) إضافية:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Fragment</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">List</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Fragment</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>first child<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>second child<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>third child<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Fragment</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n</code></pre>\n<p>أو يمكنك كتابتها باستخدام <code>&lt;&gt;&lt;/&gt;</code> إذا أُعدّ بشكل صحيح.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">List</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>first child<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>second child<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>third child<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/&gt;</span></span>\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"propswithchildren\"><code>PropsWithChildren</code></h2>\n<p>يمكنك استخدام <code>PropsWithChildren</code> لاستنتاج عنصر فرعي (child element) بشكل صحيح في مكوّن دالة (function component).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">PropsWithChildren</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Post</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Component</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ title, children }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">PropsWithChildren</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Post</span>&gt;</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>{title}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n      {children}\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"إدراج-html-خام\">إدراج HTML خام</h2>\n<p>لإدراج HTML مباشرة، استخدم <code>dangerouslySetInnerHTML</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/foo&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inner = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">__html</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;JSX &amp;middot; SSR&#x27;</span> }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Div</span> = <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dangerouslySetInnerHTML</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{inner}</span> /&gt;</span></span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الحفظ-المؤقت\">الحفظ المؤقت</h2>\n<p>حسِّن مكوّناتك عبر تخزين النصوص المحسوبة مؤقتاً (memoizing) باستخدام <code>memo</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { memo } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Header</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">memo</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span>Welcome to Hono<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">header</span>&gt;</span></span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Footer</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">memo</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>Powered by Hono<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span></span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Layout</span> = (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Header</span> /&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Hono is cool!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Footer</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"السياق\">السياق</h2>\n<p>باستخدام <code>useContext</code>، يمكنك مشاركة البيانات عالميًا عبر أي مستوى من شجرة المكونات دون تمرير القيم عبر الخصائص (props).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">FC</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createContext, useContext } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> themes = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">light</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;#000000&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">background</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;#eeeeee&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dark</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;#ffffff&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">background</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;#222222&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ThemeContext</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createContext</span>(themes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">light</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Button</span>: <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">FC</span> = <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useContext</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ThemeContext</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{theme}</span>&gt;</span>Push!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span></span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Toolbar</span>: <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">FC</span> = <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Button</span> /&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ThemeContext.Provider</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{themes.dark}</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Toolbar</span> /&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ThemeContext.Provider</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مكون-غير-متزامن\">مكوّن غير متزامن</h2>\n<p><code>hono/jsx</code> يدعم مكوّنًا غير متزامن، لذا يمكنك استخدام <code>async</code>/<code>await</code> في مكوّنك.\nإذا قمت بعرضه باستخدام <code>c.html()</code>، سينتظر تلقائيًا.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">AsyncComponent</span> = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">r</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(r, <span class=\"hljs-number\">1000</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// sleep 1s</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>Done!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">AsyncComponent</span> /&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"suspense\">Suspense <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p>الشبيه بـ <code>React</code> <code>Suspense</code> الميزة متاحة.\nإذا قمت بتغليف المكوّن غير المتزامن بـ <code>Suspense</code>، سيتم عرض المحتوى في الاحتياط (fallback) أولًا، وبمجرد حل الوعد (Promise)، سيتم عرض المحتوى المُنتظَر.\nيمكنك استخدامه مع <code>renderToReadableStream()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { renderToReadableStream, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Suspense</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx/streaming&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">//...</span>\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> stream = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">renderToReadableStream</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Suspense</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fallback</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">div</span>&gt;</span>loading...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>}&gt;\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Component</span> /&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Suspense</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">body</span>(stream, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">headers</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Content-Type&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;text/html; charset=UTF-8&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Transfer-Encoding&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;chunked&#x27;</span>,\n    },\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"errorboundary\">ErrorBoundary <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p>يمكنك التقاط الأخطاء في المكوّنات الفرعية باستخدام <code>ErrorBoundary</code>.</p>\n<p>في المثال أدناه، سيعرض المحتوى المحدَّد في <code>fallback</code> إذا حدث خطأ.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">SyncComponent</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Error&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>Hello<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/sync&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ErrorBoundary</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fallback</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">div</span>&gt;</span>Out of Service<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>}&gt;\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">SyncComponent</span> /&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ErrorBoundary</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>ErrorBoundary</code> يمكن استخدامه أيضًا مع المكوّنات غير المتزامنة و <code>Suspense</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">AsyncComponent</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">resolve</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(resolve, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2000</span>))\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Error</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Error&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>Hello<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/with-suspense&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ErrorBoundary</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fallback</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">div</span>&gt;</span>Out of Service<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>}&gt;\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Suspense</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fallback</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">div</span>&gt;</span>Loading...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>}&gt;\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">AsyncComponent</span> /&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Suspense</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ErrorBoundary</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"streamingcontext\">StreamingContext <Badge style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" type=\"warning\" text=\"Experimental\" /></h2>\n<p>يمكنك استخدام <code>StreamingContext</code> لتوفير تهيئة لمكوّنات البث (streaming) مثل <code>Suspense</code> و <code>ErrorBoundary</code>. هذا مفيد لإضافة قيم nonce إلى وسوم السكربت (script tags) الناتجة عن هذه المكونات لسياسة أمان المحتوى (CSP).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Suspense</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StreamingContext</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx/streaming&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> stream = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">renderToReadableStream</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">StreamingContext</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scriptNonce:</span> &#x27;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">random-nonce-value</span>&#x27; }}\n        &gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Suspense</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">fallback</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">div</span>&gt;</span>Loading...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>}&gt;\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">AsyncComponent</span> /&gt;</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Suspense</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">StreamingContext</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">body</span>(stream, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">headers</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Content-Type&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;text/html; charset=UTF-8&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Transfer-Encoding&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;chunked&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Content-Security-Policy&#x27;</span>:\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;script-src &#x27;nonce-random-nonce-value&#x27;&quot;</span>,\n    },\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>الـ <code>scriptNonce</code> ستُضاف القيمة تلقائيًا إلى أي <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> الوسوم المولَّدة بواسطة <code>Suspense</code> و <code>ErrorBoundary</code> المكوّنات.</p>\n<h2 id=\"التكامل-مع-البرمجية-الوسيطة-html\">التكامل مع البرمجية الوسيطة html</h2>\n<p>اجمع بين وسيطتي JSX وHTML للحصول على قوالب (templating) قوية.\nللحصول على تفاصيل متعمقة، راجع <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/helpers/html\">توثيق وسيط HTML</a>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { html } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/html&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">SiteData</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">children</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Layout</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">SiteData</span></span>) =&gt;\n  html`<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!doctype <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span>\n    \n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.title}</span><span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n        </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.children}</span><span class=\"language-xml\">\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n    `</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Content</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: { siteData: SiteData; name: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }</span>) =&gt; (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Layout</span> {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props.siteData</span>}&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hello {props.name}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Layout</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:name&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { name } = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> props = {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: name,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">siteData</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;JSX with html sample&#x27;</span>,\n    },\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Content</span> {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props</span>} /&gt;</span></span>)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مع-برمجية-وسيطة-لعرض-jsx\">مع برمجية وسيطة لعرض JSX</h2>\n<p>الـ <a href=\"https://hono.dev/docs/middleware/builtin/jsx-renderer\">البرمجية الوسيطة JSX Renderer</a> يتيح لك إنشاء صفحات HTML بسهولة أكبر باستخدام JSX.</p>\n<h2 id=\"تجاوز-تعريفات-الأنواع\">تجاوز تعريفات الأنواع</h2>\n<p>يمكنك تجاوز تعريف النوع (type definition) لإضافة عناصرك وسماتك المخصصة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">declare</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">module</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/jsx&#x27;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">namespace</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">JSX</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IntrinsicElements</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;my-custom-element&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLAttributes</span> &amp; {\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;x-event&#x27;</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;click&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;scroll&#x27;</span>\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n"}